{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/b99e51559b6442eaa614d2154ecad7c9.poster.avif?t=1758464791\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/b99e51559b6442eaa614d2154ecad7c9.webm?t=1758464791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>My Helpers is an experimental horror game that hides a group of virtual\u2026 &quot;assistants&quot; inside your machine. FIND THEM by combing through your real files, exploring weird applications, and using your computer in ways you may have never expected - and remember: this is just a game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR COMPUTER IS THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/f61fa5383ceaa5e953a3c2ef7ef3dbf3.poster.avif?t=1758464791\" width=1170 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/f61fa5383ceaa5e953a3c2ef7ef3dbf3.webm?t=1758464791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with your computer's real systems in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET THE HELPERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/dfd6c496a72c0bd98c3f409ded7c99b1.poster.avif?t=1758464791\" width=1170 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/dfd6c496a72c0bd98c3f409ded7c99b1.webm?t=1758464791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Meet multiple Helpers, each a bit more... interesting than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER EXCLUSIVE APPS</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/cc74940c23cc6b8c2dc99508d69ad365.poster.avif?t=1758464791\" width=1170 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/cc74940c23cc6b8c2dc99508d69ad365.webm?t=1758464791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find each Helper\u2019s unique applications and learn their real purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>F\u0338\u0305\u0345I\u0335\u0351\u0328\u0333N\u0334\u0301\u0303\u0349\u0317D\u0335\u0308\u031c \u0334\u0311\u0342\u0355T\u0335\u031a\u0321H\u0334\u0341\u0314\u035cE\u0334\u031a\u030c\u035aM\u0337\u0306\u033b</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/89008a8f666700bd84bbadff34d82a8f.poster.avif?t=1758464791\" width=1170 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/89008a8f666700bd84bbadff34d82a8f.webm?t=1758464791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Frequently Asked Questions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: I\u2019m a content creator. Is it safe for me to stream/record gameplay of this game?</strong><br>A:\u00a0Yes! My Helpers never requires you to access sensitive areas of your machine. Also, at no point during gameplay does the game expose any information on its own. The only parts of your system that will appear on-screen are the ones you choose to open yourself. <br><br><strong>Q: How does this game actually work?</strong><br>A:\u00a0My Helpers works like any other game, the difference is that its background is \u201ctransparent\u201d (which lets you see your computer even when the game is open). Even for the mechanics that are more directly connected to your system, everything is done through public Windows APIs that are accessible to any developer.<br><br><strong>Q: How much does My Helpers actually affect my machine?</strong><br>A:\u00a0As mentioned above, My Helpers is a regular game. Any \u201cchanges\u201d made by the game cease to exist the instant you close it.<br><br><strong>Q: Why not use a simulated desktop instead of the real one?</strong><br>A:\u00a0The goal of this project is to explore gameplay opportunities that are only possible on real systems. The main inspiration is how Nintendo develops games that make use of all the features of their consoles (often in unexpected ways). In that sense, I believe there\u2019s still a lot left to try with computers as a platform.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002600?t=1758464791","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/d545b315bf2fa05c509eb93dfd6076e943aa65fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758464791","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/53ac7526e14e97888eb36ba7dd6e573b51d8809b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758464791","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/53ac7526e14e97888eb36ba7dd6e573b51d8809b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758464791","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/b99e51559b6442eaa614d2154ecad7c9.poster.avif?t=1758464791\" width=1170 height=501 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/b99e51559b6442eaa614d2154ecad7c9.webm?t=1758464791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>My Helpers is an experimental horror game that hides a group of virtual\u2026 &quot;assistants&quot; inside your machine. FIND THEM by combing through your real files, exploring weird applications, and using your computer in ways you may have never expected - and remember: this is just a game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR COMPUTER IS THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/f61fa5383ceaa5e953a3c2ef7ef3dbf3.poster.avif?t=1758464791\" width=1170 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/f61fa5383ceaa5e953a3c2ef7ef3dbf3.webm?t=1758464791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with your computer's real systems in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET THE HELPERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/dfd6c496a72c0bd98c3f409ded7c99b1.poster.avif?t=1758464791\" width=1170 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/dfd6c496a72c0bd98c3f409ded7c99b1.webm?t=1758464791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Meet multiple Helpers, each a bit more... interesting than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER EXCLUSIVE APPS</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/cc74940c23cc6b8c2dc99508d69ad365.poster.avif?t=1758464791\" width=1170 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/cc74940c23cc6b8c2dc99508d69ad365.webm?t=1758464791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find each Helper\u2019s unique applications and learn their real purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>F\u0338\u0305\u0345I\u0335\u0351\u0328\u0333N\u0334\u0301\u0303\u0349\u0317D\u0335\u0308\u031c \u0334\u0311\u0342\u0355T\u0335\u031a\u0321H\u0334\u0341\u0314\u035cE\u0334\u031a\u030c\u035aM\u0337\u0306\u033b</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/89008a8f666700bd84bbadff34d82a8f.poster.avif?t=1758464791\" width=1170 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/extras/89008a8f666700bd84bbadff34d82a8f.webm?t=1758464791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Frequently Asked Questions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: I\u2019m a content creator. Is it safe for me to stream/record gameplay of this game?</strong><br>A:\u00a0Yes! My Helpers never requires you to access sensitive areas of your machine. Also, at no point during gameplay does the game expose any information on its own. The only parts of your system that will appear on-screen are the ones you choose to open yourself. <br><br><strong>Q: How does this game actually work?</strong><br>A:\u00a0My Helpers works like any other game, the difference is that its background is \u201ctransparent\u201d (which lets you see your computer even when the game is open). Even for the mechanics that are more directly connected to your system, everything is done through public Windows APIs that are accessible to any developer.<br><br><strong>Q: How much does My Helpers actually affect my machine?</strong><br>A:\u00a0As mentioned above, My Helpers is a regular game. Any \u201cchanges\u201d made by the game cease to exist the instant you close it.<br><br><strong>Q: Why not use a simulated desktop instead of the real one?</strong><br>A:\u00a0The goal of this project is to explore gameplay opportunities that are only possible on real systems. The main inspiration is how Nintendo develops games that make use of all the features of their consoles (often in unexpected ways). In that sense, I believe there\u2019s still a lot left to try with computers as a platform.</p>","developers":["PauloH*"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002600/dce96aa09147386117aa7008aa14a94f5c386e9d/header.jpg?t=1758464791","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"My Helpers","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["PauloH*"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia\nMedo","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descript